    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just \"feeling spent.\" it's that it feels like there's no point to any of it. like, no matter how much i fight for myself to be who i am, the world is just gonna keep pushing back. it feels like i'm trapped in a loop. if i just... stopped, wouldn't that be a relief? like actually finally being at peace instead of this constant noise?",
